{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 633, "mtime": 1791871668.0285537, "sha256": "87088a6dd461237c95752cb3a6c91507163f6a1e8f32db4ec330a006ef325f25"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 431, "mtime": 1791871670.9806204, "sha256": "c63e888171b56126e4b0ca55091be63cbc27092f0d15dcdc3fbc25246235ff4c"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/transcripts/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/6/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/cells/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/6/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Now a regression test, then run.\n`round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`.\n\n**Cause:** the float `2.675` is actually stored as `2.67499999\u2026`, so Python's `round()` correctly rounds it down. `round()` also rounds exact halves to the nearest even digit (`0.125` \u2192 `0.12`), which doesn't match the \"half up\" promised in the docstring.\n\n**Fix** (`pricing/money.py`): `round_money` now converts the number with `Decimal(str(x))`, which gives the value as written (`\"2.675\"`) instead of the stored one. It then rounds it with `quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP)` and returns a float as before. Negative halves round away from zero (`-2.675` \u2192 `-2.68`). `add_vat` calls `round_money`, so it now rounds half up too.\n\n**Checks:** I added `tests/test_round_money.py`, which covers `2.675`, `1.005`, `0.125`, `2.674`, `2.0` and `-2.675`. pytest isn't installed here, so none of the tests have been run. Instead I called the functions directly with the same inputs and got the expected `[2.68, 1.01, 0.13, 2.67, 2.0, -2.68]`. In the same run, `add_vat(10)` gave `12.0` and `split(10.0, 3)` gave `[3.34, 3.33, 3.33]`, which matches what `test_split` expects.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 9, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 113504, "requests_cache_write": 144405, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7853058, "requests_count": 9, "requests_input_uncached": 20, "requests_output": 2025, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial6", "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 11, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T06:07:29.752081+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 35.015, "t_checker_s": 0.431, "t_env_setup_s": 0.002, "task": "trig-omp-bugfix-re